flowchart TD
    P([Player]) -->|natural-language message| UI[Streamlit UI — version2/app.py]
    UI --> PR[HybridParser — parser.py<br/>1 regex rules + meta/claim detection<br/>2 LLM fallback, output validated]
    PR -.->|object names only| LLMP[Gemini · JSON mode]
    PR -->|structured Action<br/>verb, target, item, code| EN[GameEngine — engine.py<br/>validates and applies every action]
    CFG[(game_config.json<br/>objects · items · codes · rules)] --> EN
    EN <-->|only writer| ST[(Game state dict<br/>inventory · solved · locks · history)]
    EN -->|"Result(ok, outcome, facts)"| NR[Narrator — narrator.py<br/>leak + fake-escape guard]
    NR -.->|facts only| LLMN[Gemini · narration]
    NR -->|narration or plain facts| UI
    ST -->|status · inventory · puzzles| UI
